    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Current Framework\"\nformat:\n  html:\n    fig-dpi: 200\neditor_options: \n  chunk_output_type: console\nwarnings: false\n---\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n\nHere you can find the current set (as of 2025-07-21) of indicators along with their indices and dimensions. This reflects the indicator refinement meetings that consolidated the economics, environment, and production dimensions, but no such process has taken place with health and social yet.\n\n## Indicator Table\n\nThe table below lets you search and filter through the indicators. Use the button to download the current set, including any filters you might have applied.\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Clean up tree\ntree <- fixed_tree %>% \n  select(dimension, index, indicator) %>% \n  unique() %>% \n  arrange(dimension, index, indicator)\n\ntable_tree <- tree %>% \n  setNames(c(names(.) %>% snakecase::to_title_case()))\n\n# Make reactable table with download button\nhtmltools::browsable(\n  tagList(\n    tags$div(\n      style = \"display: flex; margin-bottom: 20px; justify-content: center;\",\n      tags$button(\n          class = \"btn btn-primary\",\n          style = \"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 8px 12px;\",\n          tagList(fontawesome::fa(\"download\"), \"Download as CSV\"),\n          onclick = \"Reactable.downloadDataCSV('indicator_table', 'indicator_framework.csv')\"\n      )\n    ),\n    get_reactable(\n      table_tree,\n      elementId = \"indicator_table\",\n      columns = list(\n        Dimension = colDef(minWidth = 75),\n        Index = colDef(minWidth = 100),\n        Indicator = colDef(minWidth = 200)\n      )\n    )\n  )\n)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div style=\"display: flex; margin-bottom: 20px; justify-content: center;\">\n<button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 8px 12px;\" onclick=\"Reactable.downloadDataCSV(&#39;indicator_table&#39;, &#39;indicator_framework.csv&#39;)\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" style=\"height:1em;width:1em;vertical-align:-0.125em;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;font-size:inherit;fill:currentColor;overflow:visible;position:relative;\"><path d=\"M288 32c0-17.7-14.3-32-32-32s-32 14.3-32 32V274.7l-73.4-73.4c-12.5-12.5-32.8-12.5-45.3 0s-12.5 32.8 0 45.3l128 128c12.5 12.5 32.8 12.5 45.3 0l128-128c12.5-12.5 12.5-32.8 0-45.3s-32.8-12.5-45.3 0L288 274.7V32zM64 352c-35.3 0-64 28.7-64 64v32c0 35.3 28.7 64 64 64H448c35.3 0 64-28.7 64-64V416c0-35.3-28.7-64-64-64H346.5l-45.3 45.3c-25 25-65.5 25-90.5 0L165.5 352H64zm368 56a24 24 0 1 1 0 48 24 24 0 1 1 0-48z\"/></svg>\nDownload as CSV\n</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"reactable html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"indicator_table\" style=\"width:auto;height:auto;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"indicator_table\">{\"x\":{\"tag\":{\"name\":\"Reactable\",\"attribs\":{\"data\":{\"Dimension\":[\"economics\",\"economics\",\"economics\",\"economics\",\"economics\",\"economics\",\"economics\",\"economics\",\"economics\",\"economics\",\"economics\",\"economics\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"health\",\"health\",\"health\",\"health\",\"health\",\"health\",\"health\",\"health\",\"health\",\"health\",\"health\",\"health\",\"health\",\"health\",\"health\",\"health\",\"health\",\"health\",\"health\",\"health\",\"health\",\"health\",\"production\",\"production\",\"production\",\"production\",\"production\",\"production\",\"production\",\"production\",\"production\",\"production\",\"production\",\"production\",\"production\",\"production\",\"production\",\"social\",\"social\",\"social\",\"social\",\"social\",\"social\",\"social\",\"social\",\"social\",\"social\",\"social\",\"social\",\"social\",\"social\",\"social\",\"social\",\"social\",\"social\",\"social\",\"social\",\"social\",\"social\",\"social\",\"social\"],\"Index\":[\"access to capital/credit\",\"community economy\",\"community economy\",\"distribution chain localness\",\"food business resilience\",\"food business resilience\",\"food business resilience\",\"food business resilience\",\"food business resilience\",\"tbd index\",\"tbd index\",\"value from rural landscape\",\"carbon, ghg, nutrients\",\"carbon, ghg, nutrients\",\"carbon, ghg, nutrients\",\"forest\",\"forest\",\"soils\",\"soils\",\"soils\",\"species and habitat\",\"species and habitat\",\"species and habitat\",\"water\",\"water\",\"education\",\"food security\",\"food security\",\"food security\",\"food security\",\"food security\",\"happiness\",\"happiness\",\"happiness\",\"intention to consume pbp\",\"mental health\",\"mental health\",\"mental health\",\"mental health\",\"mental health\",\"physical health\",\"physical health\",\"physical health\",\"physical health\",\"physical health\",\"physical health\",\"stability agency\",\"imports vs exports\",\"imports vs exports\",\"product quality\",\"product quality\",\"product quality\",\"product quality\",\"production diversity\",\"production efficiency\",\"production margins\",\"production margins\",\"production margins\",\"production margins\",\"production margins\",\"production margins\",\"waste and losses\",\"community embeddedness\",\"community embeddedness\",\"community embeddedness\",\"community embeddedness\",\"community embeddedness\",\"community embeddedness\",\"community embeddedness\",\"community livability\",\"community livability\",\"community livability\",\"community livability\",\"community livability\",\"food and farmworker diversity\",\"food and farmworker diversity\",\"food and farmworker diversity\",\"food and farmworker diversity\",\"food system governance\",\"food system governance\",\"food system governance\",\"food system governance\",\"food system governance\",\"food system governance\",\"food system governance\",\"food system governance\"],\"Indicator\":[\"access to land\",\"business failure rate of food business\",\"wealth/income distribution\",\"% of farm/business inputs bought locally\",\"income stability\",\"market mix\",\"marketplace\",\"operations diversification\",\"use of ag/farm/crop insurance\",\"market vacancy/health index\",\"precarity index\",\"diversity of farm types\",\"carbon fluxes\",\"carbon stocks\",\"embodied carbon\",\"forest complexity\",\"forest health\",\"biology\",\"chemistry\",\"structure\",\"biodiversity\",\"land use diversity\",\"sensitive or rare habitats\",\"water quality\",\"water quantity\",\"educational attainment\",\"access to culturally appropriate food\",\"dietary quality\",\"food access\",\"food affordability\",\"food agency\",\"Satisfaction and flexibility\",\"finding meaning in life\",\"happiness tbd\",\"intention to consume pbp tbd\",\"Access to social support\",\"Risk aversion (e.g., social stigma)\",\"Stress and anxiety\",\"Uncertainty\",\"mental health tbd\",\"access to care\",\"housing supply and quality\",\"mobility, pain\",\"nutritious diets\",\"physical health tbd\",\"presence of metabolic disease/Diet related non-communicable diseases\",\"farmer agency to improve\",\"total quantity exported\",\"total quantity imported\",\"certificates of assurance\",\"nutrition\",\"product quality tbd\",\"product safety (not livestock)\",\"production species diversity\",\"technology adoption\",\"production inputs\",\"total quantity food products\",\"total quantity forest products\",\"total quantity non-food ag products\",\"value added market\",\"yield\",\"crop failure\",\"belonging to community\",\"collective action\",\"common goals\",\"reciprocity\",\"social connectedness\",\"tradition/heritage\",\"trust\",\"NIMBYism\",\"community safety\",\"diverse representation\",\"open spaces and natural beauty\",\"outmigration\",\"age diversity\",\"gender diversity\",\"racial diversity\",\"sexuality\",\"behaviors/decisions/motivations\",\"conservation program\",\"farmer stewardship ethic\",\"government responsiveness\",\"participatory governance\",\"policies\",\"regulations and incentives\",\"transparency\"]},\"columns\":[{\"id\":\"Dimension\",\"name\":\"Dimension\",\"type\":\"character\",\"minWidth\":75},{\"id\":\"Index\",\"name\":\"Index\",\"type\":\"character\",\"minWidth\":100},{\"id\":\"Indicator\",\"name\":\"Indicator\",\"type\":\"character\",\"minWidth\":200}],\"resizable\":true,\"filterable\":true,\"searchable\":true,\"defaultPageSize\":10,\"showPageSizeOptions\":true,\"onClick\":\"select\",\"highlight\":true,\"bordered\":true,\"striped\":true,\"compact\":true,\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"14px\"},\"elementId\":\"indicator_table\",\"dataKey\":\"da2cb99aa62f56e80c147187561eb67b\"},\"children\":[]},\"class\":\"reactR_markup\"},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n## Dimension Graphs\n\nBelow are graphs showing the same information as in the table. From left to right are the dimensions, indices, and indicators.\n\n### Economics\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nplots$econ <- get_dimension_ggraph(\n  framework_df = tree,\n  include_metrics = FALSE,\n  dimension_in = 'economics',\n  y_limits = c(-3.75, 3.25),\n  palette = \"scico::batlowW\"\n)\nplots$econ\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](current_framework_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-1-1.png){width=2000}\n:::\n:::\n\n\n### Environment\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nplots$env <- get_dimension_ggraph(\n  framework_df = tree,\n  include_metrics = FALSE,\n  dimension_in = 'environment',\n  y_limits = c(-4.5, 3.25),\n  palette = \"scico::batlowW\"\n)\nplots$env\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](current_framework_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-2-1.png){width=100%}\n:::\n:::\n\n\n### Health\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nplots$health <- get_dimension_ggraph(\n  framework_df = tree,\n  include_metrics = FALSE,\n  dimension_in = 'health',\n  y_limits = c(-4.5, 3.25),\n  palette = \"scico::batlowW\"\n)\nplots$health\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](current_framework_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-3-1.png){width=1800}\n:::\n:::\n\n\n### Production\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nplots$prod <- get_dimension_ggraph(\n  framework_df = tree,\n  include_metrics = FALSE,\n  dimension_in = 'production',\n  y_limits = c(-4.5, 3.25),\n  palette = \"scico::batlowW\"\n)\nplots$prod\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](current_framework_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-4-1.png){width=1800}\n:::\n:::\n\n\n### Social\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nplots$social <- get_dimension_ggraph(\n  framework_df = tree,\n  include_metrics = FALSE,\n  dimension_in = 'social',\n  y_limits = c(-3, 3.25),\n  palette = \"scico::batlowW\"\n)\nplots$social\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](current_framework_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-5-1.png){width=1800}\n:::\n:::\n\n",
